  "detailed_description": "The &amp;quot;Scheme on Promotion of Use of Liquid Fermented Organic Manure (LFOM) for Increasing Organic Carbon in Soil&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to encourage farmers to adopt eco-friendly agricultural practices. The scheme provides financial assistance of ₹4,000 per acre to farmers who utilize LFOM or Fermented Organic Manure (FOM) in their farming operations.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a farmer.\n  - The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n  - The applicant must be engaged in agricultural activities.\n  - The applicant must be willing to adopt LFOM/FOM on their farm.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
